WEBVTT

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.760
With this, happiness will return 
to the Field of Light mepo!

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.430
Nothing's happening...

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.090
What's wrong? Come on...

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:27.670
Come on...

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.770
Look mipo!

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.520
It's so beautiful.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.160
I'm sure that rainbow is connected 
to the Field of Light mepo.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.680
Something's coming.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:57.460
Popo!

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.550
It's Pollun mepo!

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.370
Pollun?

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.050
Pollun. Pollun!

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.340
I'm Pollun popo.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.930
Now it's "popo."

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.310
By any chance, did you come 
from the Field of Light?

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.270
Pretty Cure will come, too popo.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.990
What? We're going to the Field of Light, too?

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:42.110
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:47.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.530
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:06.400
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.550
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.620
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.470
No! No! No! Popo!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.430
You have to come, too popo!

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:40.430
No! No! Queen said popo...

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.410
Pretty Cure has to come with me popo!

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.370
It looks like we don't have a choice...

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:47.470
Senior is waiting, too.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.070
So you have to come popo.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.380
All right, we'll go.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.890
We're all going to the Field of Light popo.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:03:00.820
How how are we going to get to the 
Field of Light on this rainbow?

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.790
It's easy popo.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.050
What do you mean?

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.520
How do we do it mepo?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.030
We'll go from here popo.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.270
From there?

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.210
Grandmother...

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.630
What's wrong with her?

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.970
She's okay popo.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.640
She's just sleeping popo.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.000
She's just sleeping?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.710
Time to go popo!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.800
Let's go mepo!

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:33.900
Wait for me mipo!

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.010
Let's go.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.170
We're moving amazingly fast.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.500
Will we be okay?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.500
I'm sure we will.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.040
What kind of place do you 
think the Field of Light is?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.270
Maybe we won't be able to live there unless

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:06.750
we turn into little creatures 
like Mipple and Mepple.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.860
I don't want to be like this!

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.340
What are we going to do if we can't go back?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:15.960
I don't want to go! No way!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.980
"LET'S GO TO THE FIELD 
OF LIGHT POPO! US, TOO?!"

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.680
We're here popo.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.120
Is this the Field of Light?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.590
That goodness! I'm still the same as I was.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.550
It's such a beautiful place, isn't it?

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.860
There are flowers everywhere!

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.530
What happened over there?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.800
That's what remains after Dotsuku 
Zone annihilated the place mepo.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.060
It's terrible.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.170
It sure is.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.140
It was such a beautiful place.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.560
Maybe with flocks of sheep...

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.780
Is that sheep?

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.480
Is that the legendary rainbow 
bridge between the two worlds?

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.120
It's awesome, isn't it?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.280
It's the first time I've seen it dapo.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.150
They brought someone with them nepo.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:18.260
Don't you know? They're 
the legendary warriors.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:21.100
Mepple! Welcome home popo!

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.470
I'm so glad you're home again pepo!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:24.970
Welcome home, Mipple.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.840
Good work pipo, Prince Pollun.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.300
I'm so glad to see all of you again mipo.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.940
Mipple!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.280
Mepple!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.370
The rainbow!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.190
The rainbow is disappearing!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:40.900
It's gone!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.350
Let's go to the Palace of Light popo.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.380
The Palace of Light?

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.390
Senior is waiting for us popo.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.210
Is that the Palace of Light?

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.120
Who is Senior? What is he?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.640
You'll find out when we get there popo.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.270
Every time I pass here, I feel so sad mipo.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.420
It's scary, isn't it?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.390
It used to be covered with flowers mepo.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.010
And it ended up like this...?

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:20.860
That's terrible.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.610
Is this the Palace of Light?

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.590
Where's the honorable Senior?

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:48.840
We're back popo.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.490
Senior mipo!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:56.790
Senior mepo!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.760
Mipple! Mepple!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.140
It's nice to have you back again.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.700
I'm so glad... So glad.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.040
You did a really good job.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:09.940
It must have been rough on you 
living on the Field of Rainbows.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:10.910
Not at all...!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.060
Taking care of Mepple was especially hard.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.860
He's so picky!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.010
I'm not...!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.660
He stays up until late at night.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.580
All he does is play.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.040
And besides, the two of 
you are too lovey dovey.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.920
You don't have to tell him that mepo!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.860
We worked hard mepo.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.980
I had a feeling it was like that.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.870
Looks like he saw right through you, Mepple.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.040
What are you all saying mepo?

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:40.610
So you are the legendary... The legendary...

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:42.840
The legendary...?

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.770
What was it now?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.800
The legendary warriors mepo.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.290
That's right. The legendary warriors.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.250
Senior! This is Nagisa Misumi mepo...

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.210
Hello...

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.120
This is Honoka Yukishiro mipo.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.210
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.480
It's nice to meet you, too.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:06.230
Gathering all seven Prism Stones is just 
what I'd expect from the legendary...

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:07.860
Legendary...?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.710
The legendary warriors mipo.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.830
That's right. Lately, I've gotten forgetful.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.110
It's not just lately mepo.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:21.540
I'm sorry... Yoko-san and Keiko-san, was it?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.950
Yoko-san...?

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:24.510
Who's that?

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:29.000
Good work, both of you. Thank you very much.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:34.290
We just did the best we could.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:34.950
Didn't we?

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.920
It's embarrassing to have you thank us.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:41.310
Without your efforts,

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:45.720
this place would have been 
attacked by the Dotsuku Zone,

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.880
and would have disappeared completely.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.990
Born out of the power of 
darkness, Dotsuku Zone

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:55.210
annihilates anything and 
everything in its path,

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.760
and grows more powerful.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:04.390
The worlds attacked by Dotsuku 
Zone have all of its energy

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:09.290
sucked out of their world until there 
is no sign of life left behind.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.090
The reason the Field of 
Light wasn't annihilated

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.350
is because we're protected 
by the power of light.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.730
Power of light?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:22.200
It's the direct opposite 
of the power of darkness.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.650
Life and hope all are all born from there.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:30.150
And the source of that 
power is the Prism Stones.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.120
So the Prism Stones are really 
something precious, aren't they?

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:40.790
That's right. If all seven of 
the Prism Stones had been taken,

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:44.790
there would have been nothing 
left of the Field of Light.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:50.510
But because Mepple and Mipple were 
guarding the last two stones,

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:53.670
the Field of Light was able to survive.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.890
Mepple! Mipple! You both 
really did a good job.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.440
It's the first time Senior 
has praised me mepo.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.410
Mepple...?

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:02.050
Yes mepo?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.420
Just what I'd expected from the Chosen...

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:07.750
The Chosen...? What was it now?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.620
Not again mepo!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.710
The Chosen Guardian mepo.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.030
That's right. It was guardian, wasn't it?

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:16.990
Mepo!

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.680
Mipple...?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.660
You don't have to force yourself...

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:23.470
Senior...? Queen is waiting for you.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.440
That's right...

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.630
We'll go, and meet Queen now.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:32.480
Queen wants the legendary... 
The legendary...?

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.770
Did you forget again mepo?

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.520
Don't worry.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:39.080
Queen would like to meet 
the legendary warriors.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.980
Queen wants to meet us?

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.010
Maybe she'll give us a reward.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:43.900
I don't think so.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:44.650
Let's go.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.490
This is awesome!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:56.090
The ceiling is so high, isn't it?

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:08.640
Come and meet Queen.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:29.500
I brought the legendary warriors, Queen.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.950
Where's Queen?

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:32.840
Where is she?

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.800
She's right in front of you.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.560
In front of us?

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.100
What's going on?

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.130
Right here.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:53.750
She's huge!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.850
Pleased to meet you.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.370
Queen?

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.340
Nagisa-san?

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.220
Yes?

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.170
Honoka-san?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:27.180
Yes?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.290
I'm so glad you came.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:36.130
And thank you so much for looking 
after Mipple and Mepple.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:39.520
Mipo...

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.430
Mepo...

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:44.410
The Field of Light can finally 
be restored to what it was.

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:50.970
But why choose ordinary middle school 
students like us for something that important?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.360
That's because...

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:55.710
It's...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.750
In other words...

00:12:58.620 --> 00:12:59.860
How should I put it...?

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.160
The reason is...

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.280
To get right to the point...

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:08.470
The reason is deep within your hearts.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.730
Deep within our hearts?

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:10.990
In our hearts?

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.930
That's right... That's what moved me.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:16.790
What in the world could that be?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:17.900
I don't know...

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.880
Do you know what it is, Mepple?

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:20.890
I don't know mepo.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.140
What about you, Mipple?

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.710
I don't know either mipo.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.360
You're so unreliable.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.750
You're the unreliable one mepo.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.220
Mepple and Mipple...

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.600
You both did a good job of 
guarding the stones, didn't you?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.590
A job well done.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.820
I'm honored by your words, Queen mipo.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.800
I'm most grateful mepo.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.090
He's crying.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.060
Aren't you glad, Mipple and Mepple?

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:45.780
Thanks to you, we have 
all seven Prism Stones.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.020
In order to restore the Field of Light,

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:54.010
we need the Prism Stones' Power of Creation.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:58.680
To bring forth that power, 
please go to the Hill of Light.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:01.010
Yes, Queen.

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:02.750
I'm counting on you.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.150
The Hill of Light?

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.620
Are we going, too?

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.140
Of course popo.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:11.380
What are we supposed to do anyway?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.510
You'll find out when you get there popo.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:15.560
Let's go.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.030
That's all he ever says.

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:19.670
In any case, let's go, and see.

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:36.150
You bring it out with the Prism 
Stones, but how do you bring it out?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.040
I don't know,

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.990
but it must be something that's 
beyond our imagination.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.470
I'm so excited!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.430
I envy that part of your personality, Honoka.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:59.530
This is the only place that escaped the 
annihilation from the power of darkness.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:04.420
In order to bring forth the 
power of the Prism Stones,

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.520
we need... Was it Yoko-san and...?

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.530
He forgot again.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.480
Who is he talking about?

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:10.810
It's Nagisa mepo!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:11.800
And Honoka mipo.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.040
Never mind.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.910
We need both of your cooperation.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.400
What should we do?

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.030
In order to bring forth 
the Power of Creation,

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:25.560
the seven of us have to come together here.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:29.070
But... Seven of us...?

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.150
That's right. There's only... one... two...

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:35.260
three... four... five... six...

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:39.140
There are only six of us.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.910
Who's the seventh one?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.450
Queen is the seventh person.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:47.520
Queen is always with us.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.030
I won't allow it.

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:04.020
I absolutely won't allow them to 
bring forth the Power of Creation.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:11.910
All seven of the Prism 
Stones are together now.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.350
Thank you for getting them all back for us.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.320
Let's get to it...

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:21.940
In the name of Queen...

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.770
Did you call?

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:38.740
Stone Keeper! You're as 
wonderful as ever mipo.

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.700
Aren't I?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.980
I don't think so mepo!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.590
Be quiet over there!

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.870
Be quiet!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.300
Wisdom!

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:48.320
Yes, sir!

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:53.250
In order to restore the Field of Light back 
to the way it was before it was annihilated,

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.240
we need the Power of Creation.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.190
I understand.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.660
The Stone Keeper's attitude is 
different than usual over here, isn't it?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.390
I told you to be quiet.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:08.370
But thanks to you, we are able to come 
together here on the Hill of Light.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.160
I'm grateful.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:17.190
Now, our hearts have all become 
one here on the Hill of Light...

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:23.290
Give us the Power of Creation in the 
name of the Field of Light's Queen...

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:36.060
Power of Creation please 
appear before us now.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:41.710
What's that?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.950
The Prism Hopish...!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.420
What happened?

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:53.350
Hurry, and gather all the stones mepo.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.680
We have to hurry, and put them back.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.330
Hurry!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.270
Something is coming!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.120
