00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:29.680
I cannot allow you to bring 
forth the Power of Creation.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.520
I thought you returned 
to the world of darkness.

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:35.230
It can't be!

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.550
Who would have thought he would be reborn,

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.560
