00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.330
What's going on?

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.980
The seven stones...

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:49.910
I'm going to get the seven stones.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:54.250
Hurry, and bring together the power 
of all seven of you once more.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.220
I won't let you!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.170
I'm scared popo!

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.570
We have to hurry!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.490
Hurry mepo!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.160
He's here mipo!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.740
Let's do it, Honoka.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:21.240
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:39.390
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.130
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.000
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.590
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.830
Go back to where you came from!

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:57.470
You both owe me...

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:01.460
