00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.980
He's really determined.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:07.290
Anger... hatred...

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:11.280
It's all pent up here in my body now...

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:14.380
And it has increased the 
power of the darkness.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.350
How could you come here?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:18.560
I've had enough of this!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.120
Black!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:38.030
White!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.420
Senior!

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.190
Pretty Cure!

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.740
The Prism Hopish is disappearing popo!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.390
You're coming with me!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.570
They're gone popo.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:14.070
What in the world...?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.370
Are you okay, White?

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.330
What's going on?

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.310
Ow... that hurts.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:44.150
Where are we?

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:47.130
Where's Ilkubo?

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:51.830
A world where darkness 
is holy... Dotsuku Zone.

00:21:57.010 --> 00:22:00.200
I am the ruler of Dotsuku Zone...

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.460
Jyaku-King!

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:04.340
So that's...

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:06.130
Jyaku-King?

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
